        "answer": {
          "text": "Tom: By the way, have you heard the gossip about Mia? She's moving to Madrid.\nSara: No way! Is she? Since when?\nTom: Since last week. Her company, it offered her a great job there.\nCarlos: Did it? Good for her. To be honest, she always wanted to live in another country.\nSara: She's very brave, Mia, isn't she?\nTom: Very. I'd miss her, though. She's a lovely friend.\nCarlos: So would I. Anyway, this soup, it's delicious. Did you make it, Sara?\nSara: I did. My grandmother, she gave me the recipe.\nCarlos: Did she? Lucky you. Shall we help you with the dishes?\nSara: I'd love that. Thank you both. And Tom still owes us a toast.\nTom: So I do! Cheers, everyone. To Mia, and to her new job!",
